WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,890
If you have anything to do with me, I’ll ask you.

2
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,770
Can you speak nicely to the little girl?

3
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:11,890
It's quite a dark move.

4
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:12,890
But I like it

5
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,330
Do you want to follow your brother?

6
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:17,050
I'll help you eat well and drink spicy food. You won't be afraid of the night you fall in love with me.

7
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,170
The head and neck are separated

8
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:22,870
No, he has a gun

9
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:24,950
Let's talk carefully if we have something to say

10
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:26,070
I am the most real person

11
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:27,230
If you don't mess with me, I can help you.

12
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,280
Are you still smashing the door of 1202?

13
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,480
I have a grudge against that woman

14
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,440
let's make a deal

15
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:35,430
I'll help you open his door

16
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:36,710
All the supplies inside belong to you.

17
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,030
Don't give me any trouble in the future

18
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:41,210
He seduced my boyfriend and stole my supplies with others.

19
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:43,330
I've wanted to deal with him for a long time. It's a deal.

20
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:45,490
From now on, ask me, Brother Dong, to go downstairs first.

21
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:46,930
You go first, I will take the rear
